        "text": {
            "description_html": "<B>Deltana JB-DASH95, Jamb Mounting Bracket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nJamb mounting bracket for use with <a href=\"/products/floor-spring-hinge-set-deltana-dash95\"><b>Deltana DASH95 Floor Spring Hinge</b></a>. Includes installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNormally the Deltana DASH95 Hinge is bolted to the floor. With this bracket you bolt the hinge to the bracket instead of the floor. The bracket is screw to the door jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Jamb Bracket for Double Action Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-JB-DASH95-specifications.pdf?v=1704262205\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana JB-DASH95U Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
